        "narrationPosX": 150,
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:接下来我要撰写的，是最后的一篇…]",
        "turnChangeOut": "fadeOut",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102951/vo_full_102909-1-1"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:讲述不仅是各个团体]@[textBlack:连魔法少女们个人的行动]@[textBlack:也不断聚集、收束向的唯一一个结局…]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102951/vo_full_102909-1-2"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:这个时候的我]@[textBlack:就像紧跟着小丽的出院一样]@[textBlack:出院了。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102951/vo_full_102909-1-3"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:虽然还没有完全痊愈]@[textBlack:但多亏了小莉和二木市的魔法少女们的魔力]@[textBlack:我出院的时间相对伤势来说还是相当早的。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102951/vo_full_102909-1-4"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:但是，我却高兴不起来。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102951/vo_full_102909-1-5"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:因为，小丽告诉我的]@[textBlack:“教授已经放弃了拯救魔法少女”的话语]@[textBlack:一直在我心中掀起波澜…]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102951/vo_full_102909-1-6"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:将魔法少女的事情扩散到全世界]@[textBlack:真的会引发让大家悲伤的结局吗…]@[textBlack:每当这反复浮现的疑问令我无比苦恼，]@[textBlack:我就会想起遇见过的魔法少女们的脸]@[textBlack:并感到放下记录的笔反而要更加不对。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102951/vo_full_102909-1-7"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:我能像这样烦恼自己的事]@[textBlack:是因为还不知道在未来会发生的事情。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102951/vo_full_102909-1-8"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:不管是听说魔法少女们分为了两大阵营]@[textBlack:带来的冲击]@[textBlack:还是亲眼见证小灯花和小音梦的豪赌]@[textBlack:给我的冲击]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102951/vo_full_102909-1-9"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:都仍未能从我心中消失…]",
